[TITLE]
Pumped tank run by [RULES] - the V-A9 system, rules instead of controls (by hand, for joukowsky tests)

[JUNCTIONS]
;ID    Elev   Demand
DIS    10     0
TOWN   0      60

[RESERVOIRS]
;ID    Head
SUMP   10

[TANKS]
;ID  Elev  InitLvl  MinLvl  MaxLvl  Diam          MinVol
TK   50    10       0       16      15.957691216  0

[PIPES]
;ID    Node1  Node2  Length  Diameter  Roughness  MinorLoss  Status
MAIN   DIS    TK     2000    300       0.05       0          Open
OUT    TK     TOWN   300     300       0.05       0          Open

[PUMPS]
;ID  Node1  Node2  Parameters
PU   SUMP   DIS    HEAD C1

[CURVES]
;ID  Flow  Head
C1   0     80
C1   100   65
C1   150   45

[RULES]
RULE start
IF TANK TK LEVEL BELOW 7
THEN PUMP PU STATUS IS OPEN
PRIORITY 1

RULE stop
IF TANK TK LEVEL ABOVE 14
THEN PUMP PU STATUS IS CLOSED
PRIORITY 1

[TIMES]
Duration            48:00
Hydraulic Timestep  0:05
Pattern Timestep    1:00

[OPTIONS]
Units     LPS
Headloss  D-W

[END]
